<!--
    Stormrift: icons. Crisp geometric outlines and faceted hex forms on a 24x24 grid echoing the Nexus UI language.
    IconMainMenu is the theme's own mark (art/mark.svg): a faceted hexagon ring enclosing three inward storm shards
    and a hex core. Playnite's menu icons keep icofont glyphs with theme brushes.
-->
